{"script":"yd_005_09","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1g","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":280,"scaleY":1,"trans":false,"bright":1,"y":-297,"img":"chara005_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1g","timeBak":300,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"nonStandBright":false,"x":280,"transTime":0,"scaleY":1,"trans":false,"bright":1,"y":-297,"img":"chara005_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]你说这些肉呀？今天去了附近的狩猎场一趟，给营地里打了些野味回来。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1f","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]这不是因为仓库里的食物不够了吗？所以我在下班后腾出时间跑了一趟，不然等肚子饿的时候连储备粮都没有。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1g","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]当然我还有一点私心啦。我想用这些食材给你烧一桌好菜。偶尔也尝尝我的手艺吧。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1d","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]你说我才刚刚连夜加班，别这么劳累？你怎么知道的……唉？[r]因为担心我好几天没回来，去旅店问过领班，还四处找过我？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1g","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]这样啊……谢谢你。其实，也不是很辛苦啦……或者说就算辛苦，也是值得的。比起加班干活，这些我都愿意干。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]唔……你都这么说了，那饱含我侍者队荣耀、技巧、信念和我辛劳的菜肴，就请{myName}好好品尝啦！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"茜塔-亲密3"}